            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Saigon 2",
            "review_text": "Stanley H\nHong Kong, China11208 contributions\n4\nDinner in Sihanoukville\nDec 2024 • Family\nThis time I'm going to talk about Seagong, not Seagong in Hong Kong. It is Vietnam, now known as Ho Chi Minh City. However, since ancient times, Ho Chi Minh City (Siyong) has been the most populated place in Vietnam. Especially after the war, the north was hot, and the Chinese who did not leave Vietnam chose to gather in the south. So Ho Chi Minh City has Chinese Street. And there are Chinese street, also representing local cuisine, will have a small level. This time, the guide will take us to a Chinese restaurant called \"Little American Seafood Winery\" to eat Vietnamese cuisine.\n\nSince it is a single meal, it has long known that it will not taste delicious. Coming, all are some simple and young salad meals. And one of them is steaming eggs. When eating the entrance, everyone is happier, because it is a three-color steam egg. Includes fresh eggs, salted eggs and leather eggs. The taste is smooth, salted eggs and salmon oil are more aromatic. Great food.\n\nIn Vietnam, especially in the south, the weather is very hot. So, drinking hot soup is better than drinking old hot soup. And that day's fish pills soup, is a very fresh and cooling soup.\n\nThen came a piece of bullshit. Smooth bullshed, has a cool part, and also a silky part. The perfect column taste becomes the key to everyone’s love of eating.\n\nIn Vietnam, there are shrimp at almost every meal. It is the second time in the Chinese restaurant, we use Chinese pepper salt to treat the shrimp. Pepper salt granite, even granite shell is also aromatic. The shrimp is cool, and because it is sweet enough, it tastes good.\n\nGrumpy meat, believe that people in any country who meet this Chinese cuisine will not dislike it. It is not an exception to the dummy meat of the day, all the team members love the taste.\n\nDinner fish, is the same delicious sweet vinegar. Just the sweet acid juice, is already attractive enough. Fish, together with the bones are baked to fragrance, and is a dish that nobody will not like.\n\nI've been to Vietnam for many days and have been wondering why I haven't eaten the common chicken, the chicken straw, etc. in Hong Kong. Later I realized that a series of spicy meats were modified Chinese Vietnamese dishes. So, I'm really right, the first one I came across in Vietnam was the chicken. In short, the chicken is fragrancy enough, smooth enough, is good food.\n\nFinally, also everyone will eat happy fork. Although not half fat thin, but each piece is sweet with wheat beans, and can be eaten from genuine seafood, the population is absolutely soluble. It is also a super-level product.\n\nThis guide says that this is one of the two good Chinese restaurants in Ho Chi Minh City. We came, and although it was just a whole meal, we were 100% able to feel the level of this restaurant. No vacation, this is indeed a very good Chinese restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten June 19, 2025",
