            "review_text": "Geoff\nLeigh-on Sea, United Kingdom226 contributions\n3\nNew place for us\nJan 2020 • Family\nHaveing been coming to saigon for the last ten years we are all ways on the look out for new restaurants. And thus little gem pop up on one of are bike rides in the evening. So we thought we give it a try. As was not disappointed.. Lovely and clean. Staff very helpful.. A big menu in English as well as Vietnamese. Food was so fresh and served hot which is a must for me. There was alot to choose from on the menu. Plus you could choose from a small to a large portion of a item. We ordered 6 items, as small portions so we could try a few things and we were impressed at how fresh it all tasted. My wife is a Chinese cook ans she was impressed. Very sensible prices. We went in the evening. But they also serve dim sum in the morning which we will go and try.\nSo all in all a lovely firendly restaurant. Ansmd a must for visiting tourist and locals..\nRead more\nWritten January 12, 2020",
